LUrlParser
------------------------------------------
Lightweight URL & URI parser (RFC 1738, RFC 3986)

Runtime requirements:
  cygwin-3.6.10-1
  libLUrlParser-devel-1.1-1bl2
  libLUrlParser1-1.1-1bl2
  libgcc1-14.4.0-1
  libstdc++6-14.4.0-1
  pkg-config-2.5.1-1

Build requirements:
(besides corresponding -devel packages)
  binutils-2.46.1-1
  cmake-4.2.1-1
  cygport-0.37.7-1
  gcc-core-14.4.0-1
  gcc-g++-14.4.0-1
  ninja-1.13.2-1

Canonical website:
  https://github.com/corporateshark/LUrlParser

Canonical download:
  https://github.com/corporateshark/LUrlParser/archive/refs/tags/release-1.1.tar.gz

-------------------------------------------

Build instructions:
  1. unpack LUrlParser-1.1-X-src.tar.xz
  2. if you use setup to install this src package,
     it will be unpacked under /usr/src automatically
        % cd /usr/src
        % cygport ./LUrlParser-1.1-X.cygport all

This will create:
  /usr/src/LUrlParser-1.1-X-src.tar.xz
  /usr/src/LUrlParser-1.1-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libLUrlParser1-1.1-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libLUrlParser-devel-1.1-X.tar.xz

-------------------------------------------

Files included in the binary package:

(LUrlParser)
  /usr/bin/lurlparser.exe
  /usr/share/doc/Cygwin/LUrlParser.README
  /usr/share/doc/LUrlParser/License.txt
  /usr/share/doc/LUrlParser/README.md

(libLUrlParser1)
  /usr/bin/cygLUrlParser-1.dll

(libLUrlParser-devel)
  /usr/include/LUrlParser.h
  /usr/lib/libLUrlParser.dll.a
  /usr/lib/pkgconfig/LUrlParser.pc

